---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Free Real Estate CRM Quick Log Template | Birky Studio"
  description="Download a free Notion template with the 3 fields every agent actually uses: Running Note, Call Log, and Next Follow-Up. No dashboard, no clutter — just 30-second entries after every call."
  image="/images/birky-mascot.jpg"
>
  <section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a 0%,#1e1b4b 50%,#312e81 100%);padding:100px 0 80px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
    <div style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%,rgba(99,102,241,0.15),transparent 50%),radial-gradient(circle at 80% 50%,rgba(236,72,153,0.1),transparent 50%);"></div>
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;">
      <div style="font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:20px;">⏱️</div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.8rem);font-weight:800;color:white;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.15;">
        The 30-Second Post-Call Log That Changes Everything
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem;color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;max-width:550px;margin:0 auto 32px;">
        Three fields. No dashboard. No navigation. Just paste after every call and never ask <em>"remind me where we're at"</em> again.
      </p>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;">
        <a href="#get-template" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:1.1rem;padding:16px 36px;">
          Get the Free Template →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:60px 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a0f2e 0%,#2d1b4e 100%);">
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;">
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:24px;text-align:center;">
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:#818cf8;">3</div>
          <div style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.9rem;">Fields. That's it.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:#818cf8;">30</div>
          <div style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.9rem;">Seconds per entry</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:#818cf8;">100%</div>
          <div style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.9rem;">Free. No strings.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:80px 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a 0%,#1e1b4b 100%);">
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">The Problem Every Agent Knows</h2>
      <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        You finish a call. You hang up. You're already walking to the next thing.
      </p>
      <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        The lender said something important about the binder. The buyer mentioned they're flexible on closing dates. The seller wants to counter next week.
      </p>
      <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;">
        You tell yourself you'll remember. You won't. And the next time you talk to them, you open with <strong style="color:white;">"remind me where we're at"</strong> — and they wonder why they're paying you.
      </p>
      <div style="padding:24px;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(129,140,248,0.3);border-radius:12px;">
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;font-style:italic;margin:0;">
          "The fix isn't more automation. It's making the 'update the note' habit frictionless enough that you actually do it."
        </p>
        <p style="color:#818cf8;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:8px;">— Real estate agent who built this system</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:80px 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a0f2e 0%,#2d1b4e 100%);">
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">What's Inside the Template</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;gap:20px;">
        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="font-size:1.8rem;flex-shrink:0;">📞</div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="color:white;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:1.05rem;">Running Note</h3>
            <p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:0;">One field. Paste after every call. Who called, what they said, what you need to do. No dashboard to open, no tabs to navigate.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="font-size:1.8rem;flex-shrink:0;">📋</div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="color:white;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:1.05rem;">Call Log</h3>
            <p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:0;">Phone updates from lenders, title companies, and inspectors — all in one place instead of scattered across texts, emails, and sticky notes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="font-size:1.8rem;flex-shrink:0;">📅</div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="color:white;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:1.05rem;">Next Follow-Up</h3>
            <p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:0;">Set what to do, by when, and who's responsible. Never drop a ball because you forgot what you promised.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="get-template" style="padding:80px 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a 0%,#1e1b4b 100%);">
    <div style="max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;text-align:center;">
      <div style="font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:16px;">⏱️</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:12px;">Get Your Free Template</h2>
      <p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:32px;">
        Drop your email below and get the Quick Log template link. Takes 10 seconds to duplicate into your Notion.
      </p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <input type="email" id="lead-email" placeholder="your@email.com" style="flex:1;min-width:200px;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);color:white;font-size:1rem;outline:none;" />
        <input type="text" id="lead-name" placeholder="First name" style="flex:1;min-width:140px;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);color:white;font-size:1rem;outline:none;" />
        <button onclick="submitLead()" class="btn btn-primary" style="flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 28px;font-size:1rem;">
          Get It Free →
        </button>
      </div>
      <p id="form-message" style="color:#6ee7b7;font-size:0.9rem;margin-top:16px;display:none;"></p>
      <p style="color:#64748b;font-size:0.8rem;margin-top:12px;">No spam. Ever. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:60px 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a0f2e 0%,#2d1b4e 100%);text-align:center;">
    <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;color:white;margin-bottom:12px;">Want the Full CRM?</h2>
      <p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:24px;">
        The Quick Log is one piece of a complete real estate business system — CRM, listings, appointments, commissions, and tasks all linked together. Built by an agent, for agents.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:1rem;padding:14px 28px;">Learn About the Full System →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    window.submitLead = function() {
      const email = document.getElementById('lead-email').value.trim();
      const name = document.getElementById('lead-name').value.trim();
      const msg = document.getElementById('form-message');
      
      if (!email) {
        msg.style.color = '#f87171';
        msg.textContent = 'Please enter your email';
        msg.style.display = 'block';
        return;
      }
      
      // Send to the lead capture webhook
      fetch('https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbyY6p6a7Mpve8MsSBx5R6RU1JbuNctGJHWC827dpbjpMeQOwXZlW8Bu01RXk8N0mvHr/exec', {
        method: 'POST',
        mode: 'no-cors',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({
          name: name || 'Quick Log Lead',
          email: email,
          phone: '',
          interest: 'Quick Log Template',
          source: 'quick-log-freebie'
        })
      });
      
      msg.style.color = '#6ee7b7';
      msg.style.display = 'block';
      msg.innerHTML = '✅ Thanks! Here is your template link:<br><br><a href="https://snowy-linseed-77a.notion.site/Quick-Log-Post-Call-Entry-Template-Free-3d00f60063d28100bae5e7273348851c" target="_blank" style="color:#818cf8;font-weight:600;font-size:1.2rem;">📋 Duplicate the Quick Log Template →</a><br><br><small style="color:#64748b;">Click "Duplicate" at the top-right in Notion to save your own copy.</small>';
      
      document.getElementById('lead-email').value = '';
      document.getElementById('lead-name').value = '';
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>